  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Namibian Broadcasting Corporation and Swedish     Radio Capacity building for Public Service, ph 2 - NAM NBC and SR capacity building</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sveriges Radio och NBC fas 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">F&#xf6;reslagna utvecklingsinsats inom akt&#xf6;rssamverkan &#xe4;r fas 2 av ett     tidigare samarbete och partnerskap mellan Namibian Broadcasting       Corporation (NBC) och Sveriges Radio (SR).  Insatsens &#xf6;vergripande    syfte &#xe4;r att intensifiera och underl&#xe4;tta p&#xe5;g&#xe5;ende                     demokratiseringsprocess och h&#xe5;llbara marknadsekonomi i Namibia genom  en fortsatt utveckling av media och d&#xe5; specifikt inom public service.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The development intervention &quot;Capacity Building for Public Service    Broadcasting at Namibian Broadcasting Corporation in partnership with Swedish Radio&quot; is phase 2 of a Partner Driven Corporation. The        overall objective is to enhance the ongoing process of building a     democratic society and sustainable free market economy in Namibia     through continued development of the media sector. This in turn will</narrative>
  </description>
